#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1114 expect=noViolation domain=AE
#note "Every populated AEBODSYS is a System Organ Class of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary. The PMDA sheet says Case-insensitive, so the rule authors case_sensitive: false (D-TA-3 / Fix #266) and the upper-case variant passes too; the empty AEBODSYS on row 3 does not fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset AE
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AEBODSYS type=Char
---
001 | Nervous system disorders
001 | GASTROINTESTINAL DISORDERS
002 |
